{"title": "Leadership (Condition)", "pageid": 29963, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Leadership_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack priority", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Leadership Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Leadership</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Bolstered with supernatural resolve. Attacks deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">HOBGOBLIN_LEADERSHIP</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CHOBGOBLIN_LEADERSHIP%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CHOBGOBLIN_LEADERSHIP%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" title=\"Stack priority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/38px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/50px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stack priority\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack priority\">Stack priority</a>: 0</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Leadership\">Sources of Leadership</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"min-width: 30px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Leadership_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Leadership Aura (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Leadership Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Leadership_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Leadership Aura (Condition)\">Leadership Aura</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Leadership\" title=\"Leadership\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Leadership_Icon.webp/30px-Leadership_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Leadership_Icon.webp/45px-Leadership_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Leadership_Icon.webp/60px-Leadership_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Leadership\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Leadership_Icon.webp/30px-Leadership_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/77/Leadership_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Leadership\" title=\"Leadership\">Leadership</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>HOBGOBLIN_LEADERSHIP</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Leadership\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Leadership_(Condition)\" title=\"Leadership (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Leadership\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Leadership</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Bolstered with supernatural resolve. Attacks deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Leadership_Aura\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Leadership_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Leadership Aura (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Leadership Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Leadership_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Leadership_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Leadership Aura (Condition)\">Leadership Aura</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Allied creatures within 6 m (20 ft) deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a> on their attacks.</li>\n<li>Non-branded creatures within 6 m (20 ft) are marked as the <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute%27s_Enemy_(Condition)\" title=\"Absolute's Enemy (Condition)\">Absolute's Enemies</a>.<abbr title=\"Tactician and Honour mode only\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source nomobile\">T</abbr><sup class=\"mobileonly\">Tactician</sup></li>\n<li>These effects will end if <a href=\"/wiki/Dror_Ragzlin\" title=\"Dror Ragzlin\">Dror Ragzlin</a> is incapacitated.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715075318\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.068 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.076 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2327/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33770/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9564/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: